#: views/attributes.py:75
msgid "Create product attribute"
msgstr "إنشاء خاصية منتج"

#: views/attributes.py:76
msgid ""
"\n"
"    Create a new product attribute with optional values.\n"
"\n"
"    Example request:\n"
"    ```json\n"
"    {\n"
"        \"name\": \"Color\",\n"
"        \"type\": \"color\",\n"
"        \"values\": [\n"
"            {\"value\": \"Red\", \"color_hex\": \"#FF0000\", \"sort_order\": 0},\n"
"            {\"value\": \"Blue\", \"color_hex\": \"#0000FF\", \"sort_order\": 1}\n"
"        ]\n"
"    }\n"
"    ```\n"
"\n"
"    **Rate Limit:** 30 requests per minute (sensitive operation)\n"
"    "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"    إنشاء سمة منتج جديدة مع قيم اختيارية.\n"
"\n"
"مثال الطلب:\n"
"```json\n"
"{\n"
"        \"name\": \"Color\",\n"
"        \"type\": \"color\",\n"
"        \"values\": [\n"
"            {\"value\": \"Red\", \"color_hex\": \"#FF0000\", \"sort_order\": 0},\n"
"            {\"value\": \"Blue\", \"color_hex\": \"#0000FF\", \"sort_order\": 1}\n"
"        ]\n"
"    }\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"**محدودية المعدل:** 30 طلبًا في الدقيقة (إجراء حساس)\n"
"    "

