"    - set: Set on_hand to the specified quantity\n"
"    - adjust: Add quantity to on_hand (can be negative for decrements)\n"
"\n"
"    Uses StockItem.adjust_stock() for 'adjust' type, creating StockMovement audit records.\n"
"    "
